1. Repetition. The same few aha moments are reskinned across cities. 'Split the long line' runs through all ten cities. 'Leave the silent or pretty stop unbuilt' recurs at L17, L32, L43, L46, L76, L89, L90, L94, L107 and L120. The 'heavy pair shares a line' idea recurs at L9, L70, L79, L106 and L112. The 'ferry or carriage on the capped line' idea recurs at L53, L92, L104 and L117. A few levels are near-clones: L79 repeats L9, L107 repeats L89, L104 repeats L92, L117 repeats L53, L67 repeats L36, and L43 repeats L7. Nearly every level is 'avoid the one tempting wrong layout', so the set has little variety in what the player has to do.
