   - L5's 'Why' text is truncated.
3. Verification and tone. Trap rate is 0 on every measured level, which makes the metric useless as a fairness signal, and it is '?' on all the search-cap bosses. The late game (L100-L120) has several casual rates near 47-50% in a row. That clashes with a 'gentlest metro builder' promise, even though the studio target allows it. L120 is the hardest level in the set at 44% casual. It is billed as a 'calm, readable' send-off, and it does not recap hills, ferries, snow or interchanges.
